# [F076] Registry pinning — defense in depth. The ROOT .npmrc pins the registry, but pnpm reads
# PROJECT config from ${cwd}/.npmrc ONLY — it never walks up. Without a pin here an ambient
# NPM_CONFIG_REGISTRY, or a `registry=` line in the runner's own ~/.npmrc, would silently resolve
# every dependency from a mirror we did not choose.
# Asserted by tests/unit/lint/subproject-install-script-hardening.test.ts.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org
